losk (2.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * LoskV2 rewrite by ZeshMC.
  * Compact desktop-style layout with correct key widths.
  * Real numeric keypad with tall plus and Enter, duplicate plus removed.
  * Latching modifiers and shifted key labels.
  * Offline word suggestions that learn frequently used words.
  * Graceful fallback when uinput is unavailable.
  * Always-on-top and focus return handling.

